===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*plew-}}
From {{uder|en|grc|πνευμονία||lung disease}}, from {{m|grc|πνεύμων||lung}} + {{m|grc|-ία}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/njuˈməʊniə/}}
